{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011Cgj4V38NU8VgtMiFrc4Xk","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"*The door stands before you — ancient, immense, and utterly still.*\n\n*There is no handle. No keyhole. No hinges visible.*\n\n*Its surface is a single slab of dark material that seems to drink in light. Across its face, faint symbols shift like something alive beneath ice.*\n\n*You said \"key.\"*\n\n*The word hangs in the air. The door does not move.*\n\n*But something changes. The symbols slow their drifting. They align, momentarily, into a pattern that almost resembles a question:*\n\n**Which door did you name?**\n\n*The surface ripples, waiting. It will become what you declare it to be. But it must be declared. A door without a name is every door and none.*\n\n*Name me.*"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":41,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":175,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}